	"hardwareControls": [
		"16 velocity-sensitive pads",
		"Four Q-Link knobs",
		"Touchscreen",
		"Two DIN MIDI outputs"
	],
	"notice": "Original MPC Live. In standalone mode, route a MIDI track to a DIN output connected to your computer MIDI interface; the USB-A ports host other devices. For USB controller operation use the supported MPC software and driver configuration. Pad notes 36-51 and Q-Link CC16-19 are virtual defaults, not a factory preset: configure MIDI Control mode output and use MIDI learn to match the project, pad bank and knob assignments. Set Q-Links to absolute CC mode.",
